  "Eight cards in one DashboardGrid: three KPIs then CPU fill the first row at four columns, the 24 h traffic chart spans 2 between the memory gauge and the disk donut, services span 2 as a two-column RowList",
  "Lower-is-better metrics (latency, error rate) pass invert to BigNumber and TrendSparkline so a fall is green",
  "Disk has priority 2: hidden on a phone, which keeps the numbers that matter in the first screens",
  "headerEnd puts an incident Badge on the title line"
